 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Though the earth gives way beneath us and the mountains start to fall",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Down into the heart of the sea, we will not fear at all",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the waters roar and foam and the hills shake at their swell",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We have found a stronger shelter than the walls in which we dwell",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God is our refuge and strength",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A help in troubles, always to be found",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD of hosts is with us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The God of Jacob is our fortress",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There's a river in the city and its streams run clear and wide",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God is in her midst, she will not be shaken, he is at her side",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nations rage and kingdoms totter, at his voice the earth melts down",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
